  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/11/Choco_Bunny.png/revision/latest?cb=20240626212806\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Chocolate Bunny\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Bunny\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/11/Choco_Bunny.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20240626212806\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Chocolate Bunny</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Chocolate Bunny is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">currency</a> used to buy special prizes from the <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">catalogue</a>. It's part of the Easter 2023 and 2024 event.\n</p><p>It is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 17.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Getting chocolate bunny</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d8/Riverboat.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130128022343\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d8/Riverboat.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20130128022343\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"104\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Each boat during the event requires one type of <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-easter-egg-maker-products-35773\" title=\"Category:Easter Egg Maker Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">egg</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/easter-egg-maker-35764\" title=\"Easter Egg Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">easter egg maker</a>. Filling any box with an egg gives you a certain amount of chocolate bunny.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using chocolate bunny</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Catalogue</a></i>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b4/Catalogue_Front_With_Chocolate_Bunny.png/revision/latest?cb=20240628222701\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"The catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"The catalogue\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b4/Catalogue_Front_With_Chocolate_Bunny.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20240628222701\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"195\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>The catalogue</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Chocolate Bunny can be used to purchase items from the \"Fyne &amp; Mysterious Gifts <a href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Catalogue</a>,\" found by clicking the blue post box at the end of the driveway. Different gifts have different prices.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831074002\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 761/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 331/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 47/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: